---
import { Font } from "astro:assets";
import ThemeScript from "@/components/ThemeScript.astro";
import ThemeToggle from "@/components/ThemeToggle.astro";
import "@/styles/global.css";

const origin = Astro.locals.siteUrl?.origin ?? "https://alexpatterson.dev";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<ThemeScript />
		<title>Developers, MCP &amp; API Documentation — alexpatterson.dev</title>
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Developer documentation for Alex Patterson's unauthenticated Model Context Protocol (MCP) server, OpenAPI 3.1 endpoints, and Cloudflare Workers AI headshot remix API."
		/>
		<link rel="canonical" href={`${origin}/developers`} />
		<Font cssVariable="--font-geist" preload />
		<Font cssVariable="--font-jetbrains-mono" />
	</head>
	<body class="min-h-dvh bg-[#faf9f6] dark:bg-[#13151a] text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 antialiased">
		<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-10 space-y-8">
			<header role="banner" class="pb-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
				<a href="/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 hover:underline">
					← Back to Alex Patterson Hub
				</a>
				<ThemeToggle />
			</header>

			<article class="space-y-6 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
					Developer &amp; AI Agent API Documentation
				</h1>
				<p>
					All speaker kit data on <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">alexpatterson.dev</strong> is accessible programmatically with <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">zero authentication required</strong> (<code class="font-mono text-xs text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300">auth: none</code>). Agents and conference automation pipelines can query our Model Context Protocol (MCP) server, REST JSON endpoints, or negotiate Markdown directly via <code class="font-mono text-xs text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300">Accept: text/markdown</code>.
				</p>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#1b1e26] p-6 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
					<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
						1. Unauthenticated MCP Server (<code class="font-mono text-xs text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300">POST /mcp</code>) &amp; CLI Quickstart
					</h2>
					<p>
						Connect any Streamable HTTP MCP client (<code class="font-mono text-xs">2026-07-28</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">2025-11-25</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">2024-11-05</code>) or install the official <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@modelcontextprotocol/sdk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">@modelcontextprotocol/sdk</a> package from npm to query <a href="/mcp" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">{origin}/mcp</a>. Available tools: <code class="font-mono text-xs">get_speaker_profile</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">get_speaker_bio</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">list_talk_abstracts</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">list_headshots</code>, <code class="font-mono text-xs">list_speaking_ledger</code>, and <code class="font-mono text-xs">get_full_speaker_kit</code>.
					</p>
					<pre class="rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 font-mono text-xs overflow-x-auto"><code>claude mcp add --transport http alexpatterson {origin}/mcp
npx @modelcontextprotocol/inspector {origin}/mcp
npm install @modelcontextprotocol/sdk @sanity/client</code></pre>
				</section>

				<section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-[#1b1e26] p-6 space-y-3 shadow-xs">
					<h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
						2. Discovery &amp; Specification Endpoints
					</h2>
					<ul class="space-y-1.5 font-mono text-xs">
						<li>• <a href="/speaker-kit.json" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">/speaker-kit.json</a> — Complete Speaker Kit JSON bundle</li>
						<li>• <a href="/.well-known/openapi.json" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">/.well-known/openapi.json</a> — OpenAPI 3.1.0 specification</li>
						<li>• <a href="/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json</a> — MCP Server Card</li>
						<li>• <a href="/.well-known/api-catalog" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">/.well-known/api-catalog</a> — RFC 9727 API Catalog Linkset</li>
						<li>• <a href="/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json</a> — Agent Skills Index (v0.2.0)</li>
						<li>• <a href="/AGENTS.md" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">/AGENTS.md</a>, <a href="/auth.md" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">/auth.md</a>, <a href="/pricing.md" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">/pricing.md</a>, <a href="/llms.txt" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 underline">/llms.txt</a></li>
					</ul>
				</section>
			</article>

			<footer role="contentinfo" class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-3">
				<a href="/" class="font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 hover:underline">Home</a>
				<div class="flex gap-4">
					<a href="/about" class="hover:underline">About</a>
					<a href="/contact" class="hover:underline">Contact</a>
					<a href="/privacy" class="hover:underline">Privacy</a>
				</div>
			</footer>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
